# Frontend configuration -- OPTIONAL. Copy to .env (gitignored) only to change it.
#
# The SatQuery FastAPI backend the browser calls. The default below is the
# backend `npm run dev` starts on YOUR machine. "localhost" always means the
# computer the browser runs on, so on a teammate's computer it is their own
# backend (see README.md) -- never someone else's. Point it at a deployed
# backend's URL only if one exists.
#
# Never put Supabase keys in VITE_* variables: they are bundled into the
# browser. The frontend doesn't talk to Supabase at all; the backend does.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://satquery-backend.onrender.com/
